<title>UK: Lehman leads $150 mln FRN for First Maryland.</title>
<headline>Lehman leads $150 mln FRN for First Maryland.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST MARYLAND CAPITAL II</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  FIRST MARYLAND CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *01.FEB.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +85 BP    PAY DATE    31.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   1.0</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    **</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	     *10-YEAR CALL AT PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
